        "original_id": "26b4327e-b4ae-5bcd-8a3d-8677123ea2a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: SMS Emden, Königsberg-class cruiser\n- Concepts: Iron Cross\n- Places: Kingdom of Prussia, German Empire, Nazi Germany\n\nFacts:\n- SMS Emden was a German light cruiser of the Königsberg class built during the First World War.\n- SMS Emden mounted an Iron Cross on her stem-head in honor of the earlier Emden.\n- The Iron Cross was a military decoration in the Kingdom of Prussia and later in the German Empire from 1871 to 1918 and in Nazi Germany from 1933 to 1945.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
